# Response headers of the Studio's static assets (Workers static assets, issue #224). API answers set
# their own (packages/service-kit json()). The script hash is the theme script in index.html: after
# editing it, `node scripts/csp-hash.mjs` prints the new one (`pnpm build` fails until it matches).
# img-src: OpenStreetMap tiles (Leaflet). connect-src: the weather forecast (weather.ts); 'self' covers
# the preview websocket. style-src 'unsafe-inline': Leaflet and the components position with style attributes.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-5SNj+TCNUgM0+mejknAlh+yJFdzS9KVY2nXqj88YsAU='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tile.openstreetmap.org; connect-src 'self' https://api.open-meteo.com; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=()
